    Left Button Draw: Set expressions
    Shift + Left Button Draw: Set uniform expressions
    Right Button Draw: Reset expressions
Curve Type
    Left Button Draw: Draw
    Shift + Ctrl + Left Button Draw: Line Draw
    Shift + Left Button Draw: Horizontal Line Draw
    Right Button Draw: Reset Line</system:String>-->
